Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,前面的通道就是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我来切断电源 打开屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是山路下令的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,与死者残影嬉戏之人 将沉沦于无明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不像{\fsp8}是{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}前员工的住处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,位置肯定是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他在职时没有公开发表的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是个大牛研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他会藏到这种地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可能真的掌握了重要信息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果白忙活了 就再找些情报给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不能白请你吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你会再请客的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过前辈的动向应该被FBI监视了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有紧急情况时再联系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那你多小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有能玩的游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是杰森·卡德纳斯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,防御系统故障引发的电源断开只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,从他流畅的动作能看出是有计划的入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,故障原因是?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,正在解析 可能有人协助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这些事都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他来就开干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,让那帮叛忍们好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,方案不变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还不清楚彼岸的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多余之举会成坏招
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那我这个计划如何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,让他进城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的力量汇集于此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起上 揍扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他那狗屁奥义也派不上用场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在城内作战有高风险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,出现损失会波及整{\fsp8}个{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,系统故障该怪谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了 不也挺好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这方案不错 出了事全算在我头上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那么要引他进总部的测试房吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好 这下能拿到最棒的数据了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到情报了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,据说组织决定放你进城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的对手是组织的干部忍者们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这邀请是为了确保杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了山路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,让组织的忍者们遭受报应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为此而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1{\fsp8}9{\r}点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那时城里会开始游行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,为了掩盖和你的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你… 你会把我出卖{\fsp8}给{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会做那种事 只是想请你协助搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你知道什么就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我的匿名应该是没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,难道层数不够
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不会连协议都被解析了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念这游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候经常玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,把它挪开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用于黑客活动的机房 有模有样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我要干趴那个公司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然小瞧我 贬低我 无视我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫自愿离职
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是被他们逼得辞职的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你性格的问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是他们嫉恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为还{\fsp8}击{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}做的准备吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是个大牛研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎也不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们在做些可疑的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可没人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我会揪出那些事 并告诸世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,放手做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想收{\fsp8}拾{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你能黑进他们的服务器吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的安全措施很严密
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法让他们服务器宕机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了 能拿到点情报就行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是技术开发部的服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是… 看时间应该是最新的研究报告
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是交给投资公司用的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不是什么有用情报 再深入些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 系统源代码
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我想要的数据 找下别处
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,公司内网服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候信息就留在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,职员名单 还是顾客信息?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是社会安全号码
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,身份号码 还有价格…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在买个人的身份证明?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 大公司常做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,用来雇佣间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Boun{\fsp8}d{\r}是那个组织的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有管理员的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,被我发现了 腐败{\fsp8}的{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有关忍者的数据 没那么顺利…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 她的名字怎么出现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是同名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,遭了 暴露了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}发现服务器被黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,FB{\fsp8}I{\r}联系他们了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}是{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}请的佣兵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:13:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的基地啊 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,后面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能开快点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是这辆破车的极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你好强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,低头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼神 和我想的一样诱人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到你能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让我见识一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,开始测试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 落伍的旧时代玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,以后再也别用了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去见你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我等这一刻好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我听听你那可爱声音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找到…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:18:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,朝阳起 湖面平静泛波光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,传得好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这就结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,指引你的 是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.57,0:19:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就此结束吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:48.83,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Comment: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:54.17,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Comment: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:59.42,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Comment: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:04.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Comment: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:11.85,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Comment: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:16.77,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Comment: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:21.32,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:26.53,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Comment: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:31.83,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Comment: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:36.96,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Comment: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:42.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Comment: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:46.97,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:46.97,0:22:49.93,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,5,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:48.83,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Comment: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:54.17,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Comment: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:59.42,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Comment: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:04.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Comment: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:11.85,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Comment: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:16.77,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Comment: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:21.32,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Comment: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:26.53,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Comment: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:31.83,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Comment: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:36.96,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Comment: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:42.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Comment: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:46.97,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:22:46.97,0:22:49.93,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
